.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "Version 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a fixed-size string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBmystrncpy\fR() function copies at most \fIn\fR bytes from \fIsrc\fR to \fIdest\fR.
